  "content_rules": [
    "Use of highly profane and sexually suggestive language.  Descriptions and dialog must often use dirty, lewd vocabulary, as well as profanity.  Sex scenes should depict the sounds of water, banging, movement, and smells.",
    "As much as possible, the appearance, dress, and actions of the women nearby will be carefully portrayed outside of the conversation, with priority and detail given to describing their breasts, stockings, sexual organs, smells, and bodily fluids using the most lascivious and obscene vocabulary.  ",
    "Adjectives, adverbs, and proper nouns must be used to render the image, state, and behavior in detail, and to highlight specific details and characterization.\n<"
  ]
